@startuml UC33_AI_Indexing_Listener
title 33) Tự động chỉ mục dữ liệu khi CRUD sản phẩm (listener)
participant "ProductController/Service" as ProductSvc
participant "Domain Event" as EventBus
participant "VectorIndexService" as Indexer
database "ChromaDB" as Chroma
ProductSvc --> EventBus : Emit ProductCreated/Updated/Deleted
EventBus --> Indexer : Deliver event
alt Created/Updated
    Indexer -> Chroma : Upsert product vectors
else Deleted
    Indexer -> Chroma : Remove product vectors
end
Chroma --> Indexer : Ack
Indexer --> EventBus : Success/failure status
@enduml











